我是个超级 Pearl Jam 迷。

845
00:43:22.250 --> 00:43:26.130
And then I will get to meet Eddie Vedder.
然后我就能见到埃迪·韦德了。

846
00:43:26.930 --> 00:43:29.230
If I ever get to meet Eddie,
如果我能见到埃迪，

847
00:43:29.950 --> 00:43:31.590
Amy has to be there too.
艾米也必须在场。

848
00:43:31.870 --> 00:43:37.150
Because I bring us Amy into being a huge Pearl Jam fan too.
因为我也把艾米拉进 Pearl Jam 的超级粉丝行列了。

849
00:43:37.590 --> 00:43:38.790
We have been
我们已经

